@HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5226

# Replace these values while following the manual test flow.
@destinationUrl = https://webhook.site/replace-with-your-temporary-id
@endpointId = replace-with-endpoint-id
@inboundKey = replace-with-inbound-key
@eventId = replace-with-event-id


### Health check

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain


### 1. Create a webhook endpoint
# Copy the returned id and inboundKey into the variables above.

POST {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Manual delivery test",
  "destinationUrl": "{{destinationUrl}}"
}


### 2. Get the created endpoint

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints/{{endpointId}}
Accept: application/json


### 3. Receive an inbound webhook
# Copy the returned event id into the eventId variable above.

POST {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/in/{{inboundKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Webhook-Source: manual-test
X-Webhook-Event-Type: payment.succeeded

{
  "type": "payment.succeeded",
  "paymentId": "pay_123",
  "amount": 14990,
  "currency": "BRL"
}


### 4. List events for the endpoint

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints/{{endpointId}}/events?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json


### 5. List failed events for the endpoint

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints/{{endpointId}}/events?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Failed
Accept: application/json


### 6. List delivered events for the endpoint

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints/{{endpointId}}/events?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Delivered
Accept: application/json


### 7. Get complete event details and delivery attempts

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Accept: application/json


### Diagnostic example: unknown event returns 404

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json


### Validation example: invalid pagination returns 400

GET {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints/{{endpointId}}/events?page=0&pageSize=200
Accept: application/json

### Manually retry a failed event

POST {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/retry
Accept: application/json

### Update a webhook endpoint

PUT {{HookHarbor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/endpoints/{{endpointId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated payment endpoint",
  "destinationUrl": "{{destinationUrl}}"
}